    /**
     * Copy safe nodes from one Document to another. Safe nodes are cloned, not imported, so the source nodes can continue
     * to be used.
     *
     * @param source source document
     * @param dest   destination document
     * @return the destination document, with safe nodes from the source nodes copied. The destination document may have
